  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-21T14:19:57.190Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In the here Tab there is a button to Favorite the world / adding it to a \"Playlist\". This doesn't feel fitting, since the button in the Main Menu is called \"Favorite\". \nI don't really understand why adding a world to a list was / is considered a Playlist in the first place, this would only really make sense for game worlds and not normal Meetup / Chill worlds. Adding something to Favorites is also way easier to understand then adding something to a \"Playlist\". So please consider changing it to \"Add To Favorites\".\nI've also noticed that in the Main Menu the button is called \"Favorite\" but the popup you get has the text \"Chose a Playlist\".\nThe images below show what I mean, by this.",
